responses.response:
if you’re reading these words, then you are too.  It is our nature to have greatness available to us at any moment in time. If this doesn’t speak to the truth of who you are, then there are many ways to convince yourself otherwise:

- Don’t listen to your heart; listen to what others tell you or to the media;
- Ignore your instincts and use logic to guide you;
- Forget about how your body wants
